  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "ac1210b0-73a3-d445-2853-e4e76eb3be31",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "c26f2cdb-1975-5fe3-730f-fd3373c34522",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "As they met with all the stakeholders from the university and hospital, the same sense of excitement was expressed by them, who are impatient to see the centre open its door next year. With both medical college and school of nursing and midwifery working towards initiating their undergraduate programmes, presence of CIME also present a unique platform for interprofessional engagement and skills development.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "As we all put 2020 in our rear mirror, the new centre presents glimmer of hope for 2021 as the team works on the finalising details to allow the centre to meet the expectations of our colleagues in Nairobi.",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
